---
/*
  PAGE GOAL (HE): mirrors /systems/marketing-agency exactly — renders
  ONLY the owner-approved "מה בנינו" content from the copy file, verbatim.
  No metrics bar, no decisions table, no results table, no takeaways:
  the copy has none of that content, so none is invented here. The
  copy file's own "סטטוס" section (draft-meta about owner sign-off, not
  customer-facing) is intentionally omitted, matching the EN page.

  Copy source: .apm/memory/copy/he/case-study-marketing-he.md —
  re-read that file before editing any string below; it is the
  approved source of truth, not this file. Source tag:
